{"speciesId":423,"names":{"fr":"Tritosor","es":"Gastrodon","en":"Gastrodon","ja":"トリトドン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a pliable body without any bones. If any part of its body is torn off, it grows right back."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It apparently had a huge shell for protection in ancient times. It lives in shallow tidal pools."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When its natural enemy attacks, it oozes purple fluid and escapes."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When its natural enemy attacks, it oozes purple fluid and escapes."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses gènes ont démontré qu’il avait jadis une carapace couvrant la totalité de son dos."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses gènes ont démontré qu’il avait jadis une carapace couvrant la totalité de son dos."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Attaqué par un prédateur, il fuit en libérant un liquide mauve."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si se ve amenazado por sus enemigos naturales, segrega un líquido morado y huye rápidamente."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When its natural enemy attacks, it oozes purple fluid and escapes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"天敵に 襲われたときは 紫色の 液体を 体から 出して 逃げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Jadis, il semble qu’il portait une grande carapace pour se protéger. Il hante les eaux peu profondes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Al parecer, hace mucho tiempo tenía una gran concha protectora. Vive en aguas poco profundas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It apparently had a huge shell for protection in ancient times. It lives in shallow tidal pools."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大昔は 丈夫な 殻で 体を 守っていたらしい。 海の 浅瀬に 生息する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Attaqué par un prédateur, il fuit en libérant un liquide mauve."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Si se ve amenazado por sus enemigos naturales, segrega un líquido morado y huye rápidamente."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"When its natural enemy attacks, it oozes purple fluid and escapes."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"天敵に 襲われたときは 紫色の 液体を 体から 出して 逃げる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jadis, il semble qu’il portait une grande carapace pour se protéger. Il hante les eaux peu profondes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al parecer, hace mucho tiempo tenía una gran concha protectora. Vive en aguas poco profundas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It apparently had a huge shell for protection in ancient times. It lives in shallow tidal pools."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"大昔は 丈夫な 殻で 体を 守っていたらしい。 海の 浅瀬に 生息する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il se régénère très vite. Même si des Pokémon poissons en croquent un bout, il est à nouveau comme neuf au bout de quelques heures."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Posee una notable capacidad de regeneración. Aunque los Pokémon pez lo mordisqueen, puede recuperarse en tan solo unas pocas horas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It has strong regenerative capabilities. Even if parts of it are bitten off by fish Pokémon, it will return to normal within a few hours."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"再生能力が 高い。 さかなポケモンに 喰い千切られても 数時間で 元通りに なるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il s’alimente principalement de plancton invisible à l’œil nu. On ne sait toujours pas pourquoi il a quitté l’océan au profit de la terre ferme."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Su principal alimento es plancton invisible. Sale a la superficie, pero aún se desconoce el motivo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Plankton, invisible to the naked eye, is its main food source. It comes onto the land periodically, but the reason for this is not known."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"目に 見えない プランクトンが 主な 餌。 陸に 上ってくるが 理由は まだ わかっていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La fine soucoupe qui se trouve à l’intérieur de son dos est le dernier vestige de la carapace jadis portée par son espèce."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un caparazón le cubría la espalda antaño, y el único indicio de este hecho es la fina y dura placa en la capa interna del lomo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Long ago, it had a shell on its back. There’s now a vestigial plate on its back that’s hard but thin."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"昔は カラを 背負っていた。 背中の 奥に その名残の 硬くて 薄い 皿が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il change de forme et de couleur selon son habitat et son alimentation. On le trouve souvent sur les plages à la faible houle."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Altera tanto la forma como el color en función de su hábitat y el alimento del que se nutre. Abunda en las playas de calmo oleaje."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Their shape and color change, depending on their environment and diet. There are many of them at beaches where the waves are calm."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"棲む 場所や エサの 影響で 色や 形が 変化 する。 波の おだやかな 磯辺に 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il peut rejoindre la terre ferme pour chercher des proies. Il laisse une traînée de bave gluante derrière lui."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Puede desplazarse también por tierra firme en pos de su presa. Deja tras de sí, entonces, el rastro de una mucosidad pegajosa."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its search for food sometimes leads it onto land, where it leaves behind a sticky trail of slime as it passes through."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"エサを 求めて 陸にも 上がる。 トリトドンが 這った跡には ネバネバの 粘液が 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Son corps est caoutchouteux, mais très résistant, car la puissance des chocs qu’il subit se répand sur toute sa surface."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Aunque blando, su cuerpo es tremendamente resistente, ya que dispersa cualquier impacto que recibe dada su flexibilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The softness of its body helps disperse the force of impacts, so although its body is uncommonly squishy, it’s also surprisingly resilient."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"グニャグニャの 体 だけれど かなり タフ。 軟らかさが 衝撃を 分散するのだ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Eats beach sand for nourishment. Should one Gastrodon encounter another of a different color, a fierce battle will inevitably ensue."}],"varieties":[{"id":423,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[24,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[8,"level-up",29],[9,"level-up",29],[10,"level-up",29],[11,"level-up",29],[14,"level-up",29],[15,"level-up",29],[16,"level-up",29],[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29],[20,"level-up",25],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",25],[25,"level-up",25],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[24,"level-up",47],[25,